    {
      "name": "Call Blood",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bonusActions",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "bonus",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": null
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The vampire calls to the blood within one injured creature it can see within 10 feet of it, causing blood to pour from the creature's wounds. If the target doesn't have all its HP, it must make a DC 14 CON save, losing 7 (2d6) HP on a failed save, or losing half as much HP on a successful one. Before the end of its next turn, the vampire has advantage on the next attack roll it makes against a creature that failed the save."
